  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21526474",
      "title": "Sending a POST Request to Store Data",
      "lectureOrder": 156,
      "videoOrder": 136,
      "sourceHash": "92e02587fc5f9ca457ee4f5b1630c39a292f435811c947be0ee45ea00ad81429",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 4.31,
          "en": "So how does fetch work then?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.31,
          "end": 8.17,
          "en": "As I mentioned, we wanna provide a fast argument,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.17,
          "end": 12.05,
          "en": "which is the URL to which this request should be sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.05,
          "end": 15.21,
          "en": "Now that's the URL I got from Firebase, but actually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.21,
          "end": 17.18,
          "en": "we need to tweak it a little bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.18,
          "end": 19.73,
          "en": "You can add, after the slash here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.73,
          "end": 22.57,
          "en": "any identifier of your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.57,
          "end": 25.13,
          "en": "I'll name it surveys.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.13,
          "end": 28.873,
          "en": "And then, important add .JSON after that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.05,
          "end": 32.29,
          "en": "This is not something Vue needs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.29,
          "end": 34.22,
          "en": "or Backends in general need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.22,
          "end": 36.5,
          "en": "This .JSON at the end is just",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.5,
          "end": 38.923,
          "en": "a Firebase specific requirement.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.81,
          "end": 42.01,
          "en": "When you're working with a different Backend,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.01,
          "end": 44.11,
          "en": "there is a high chance that you don't need it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.11,
          "end": 45.973,
          "en": "But for Firebase we need to add it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.12,
          "end": 50.38,
          "en": "And this key here, surveys, that's up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.38,
          "end": 53.35,
          "en": "Firebase will then automatically create a note",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.35,
          "end": 57.113,
          "en": "in this database and store our data under that note.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.54,
          "end": 61.01,
          "en": "So that is the first part.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.01,
          "end": 64.18,
          "en": "Here we got this Fetch function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.18,
          "end": 68.03,
          "en": "Now, by default, this will try to get data from here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.03,
          "end": 72.01,
          "en": "Now here I don't wanna get data, instead, I wanna send data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.01,
          "end": 75,
          "en": "So, we can we can pass a second argument to Fetch.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75,
          "end": 77.03,
          "en": "And that is a (indistinct) object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.03,
          "end": 79.033,
          "en": "where we can configure this request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.45,
          "end": 83.41,
          "en": "And here we have a method property which we can set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.41,
          "end": 86.62,
          "en": "By default, the value is a string get,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.62,
          "end": 88.52,
          "en": "but we can set it to post.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.52,
          "end": 92.363,
          "en": "And this influences which kind of http request we send.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.47,
          "end": 96.41,
          "en": "There are get and post requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.41,
          "end": 100.95,
          "en": "Get for getting data, post for posting so for sending data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.95,
          "end": 104.2,
          "en": "And there also are other words like delete",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.2,
          "end": 107.62299999999999,
          "en": "or patch for deleting and updating.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.81,
          "end": 112.07300000000001,
          "en": "But here we need post to send a new piece of data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.52000000000001,
          "end": 116.46000000000001,
          "en": "and we also need to add some headers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.46000000000001,
          "end": 119.14,
          "en": "some metadata to this outgoing request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.14,
          "end": 123.23,
          "en": "To be precise, we should set the content type header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.23,
          "end": 127.37,
          "en": "to application/JSON, telling the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.37,
          "end": 129.91,
          "en": "that we'll add some data to this request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 129.91,
          "end": 132.73,
          "en": "which will be in the JSON format.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 132.73,
          "end": 135.16,
          "en": "Which is basically just text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.16,
          "end": 137.9,
          "en": "but text for method in a specific way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.9,
          "end": 141.203,
          "en": "which is very easy for machines to pass and read.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.15,
          "end": 144.05,
          "en": "And that's the next thing we gonna add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.05,
          "end": 146.77,
          "en": "We gotta add a body to this request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.77,
          "end": 148.423,
          "en": "Which is the data we wanna add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.28,
          "end": 153.25,
          "en": "And here of course, that should be my survey results here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.25,
          "end": 155.003,
          "en": "The name and the rating.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.82,
          "end": 160.79,
          "en": "So here I'll add a new JavaScript object as a body,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 160.79,
          "end": 164.09,
          "en": "where I set the name to this username,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 164.09,
          "end": 167.13,
          "en": "and the rating to this rating,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.13,
          "end": 168.91,
          "en": "sorry, chosen rating.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.91,
          "end": 171.82,
          "en": "So the values which I emitted in the past,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.82,
          "end": 174.45,
          "en": "are now added to this object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.45,
          "end": 177.32999999999998,
          "en": "And therefore of course here it should be entered name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 177.32999999999998,
          "end": 179.78,
          "en": "So, the values which are submitted before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 179.78,
          "end": 181.24,
          "en": "entered name and chosen rating,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 181.24,
          "end": 184.533,
          "en": "these are the values which are now encoded in this object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.07,
          "end": 188.87,
          "en": "But that's a JavaScript object as I just said,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.87,
          "end": 190.64,
          "en": "we wanna send JSON data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.64,
          "end": 194.7,
          "en": "and JavaScript has a convenient method we can use for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 194.7,
          "end": 196.46,
          "en": "There is a JSON object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 196.46,
          "end": 198.8,
          "en": "on which you can call the stringify method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 198.8,
          "end": 200.5,
          "en": "to which you can pass your object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 201.52,
          "end": 205.69,
          "en": "And this turns this JavaScript object into this JSON format",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.69,
          "end": 208.28300000000002,
          "en": "into a string that has this format we wanna send.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 210.4,
          "end": 215.21,
          "en": "And now, that will send a http request to Firebase.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 215.21,
          "end": 216.57999999999998,
          "en": "This also means that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 216.57999999999998,
          "end": 220.03,
          "en": "we no longer need to emit our custom event here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 220.03,
          "end": 221.88,
          "en": "and hence it will comment out everything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 221.88,
          "end": 223.77,
          "en": "that is related to that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 223.77,
          "end": 225.8,
          "en": "And of course it will also mean",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 225.8,
          "end": 229.363,
          "en": "that we no longer manage our data here in App.vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 230.32,
          "end": 231.51,
          "en": "Now, we could do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 231.51,
          "end": 233.57999999999998,
          "en": "you could have an application where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 233.57999999999998,
          "end": 235.13,
          "en": "you wanna send a request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 235.13,
          "end": 238.46,
          "en": "and still also manage your data locally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 238.46,
          "end": 240.55,
          "en": "That could be a scenario you have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 240.55,
          "end": 243.66,
          "en": "Here, it's just not the scenario I have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 243.66,
          "end": 246.24,
          "en": "So I will comment out the data in Appvue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 246.24,
          "end": 249.64,
          "en": "and I will comment out these methods block here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 249.64,
          "end": 251.39,
          "en": "with the store survey method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 251.39,
          "end": 254.02,
          "en": "Because we'll no longer be doing this locally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 254.02,
          "end": 256.66,
          "en": "in our Vue app, at least for this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 256.66,
          "end": 258.55,
          "en": "We are not going to do it locally anymore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 258.55,
          "end": 260.03,
          "en": "and hence we don't need that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 260.03,
          "end": 261.48,
          "en": "and the methods here anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 262.57,
          "end": 264.77,
          "en": "And that also means that we no longer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 264.77,
          "end": 268.31,
          "en": "will bind survey submit here, on the learning survey,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 268.31,
          "end": 272.203,
          "en": "and we will no longer provide results for user experiences.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 273.56,
          "end": 276.90999999999997,
          "en": "And that of course means that instead of user experiences,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 276.90999999999997,
          "end": 277.88,
          "en": "for the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 277.88,
          "end": 280.72,
          "en": "we'll no longer get a value for results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 280.72,
          "end": 282.37,
          "en": "We'll take care about that later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 284.04,
          "end": 285.9,
          "en": "Back to our learning survey,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 285.9,
          "end": 289.51,
          "en": "there we are now sending this http request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 289.51,
          "end": 291.61,
          "en": "Let's see (indistinct) that works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 291.61,
          "end": 295.28,
          "en": "Let's save everything, reload this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 295.28,
